  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cb5806404b7ebc5afe3/step-694ed300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot.\n• Thinly slice tomato into wedges.\n• In a shallow bowl, combine the plain flour and a pinch of salt and pepper. In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, combine sesame seeds and panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients).\n• Dip Japanese tofu steaks into flour mixture to coat, then into egg and finally in breadcrumb mixture. Set aside on a plate.\n• In a small bowl, combine teriyaki seasoning, the soy sauce, honey and water (for the sauce).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cb5806404b7ebc5afe3/step-8328ec10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook crumbed tofu in batches until golden and cooked through, 2-4 mins each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.\n• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium heat.\n• Add teriyaki mixture, stirring, until heated and bubbling, 1-2 mins. Transfer to another small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cb5806404b7ebc5afe3/step-9da2f020.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine salad leaves, carrot, tomato and Japanese-style dressing. Season to taste.\n• Stir the mayonnaise into the teriyaki mixture until combined.\n• Once rice is done, stir in the vinegar and a pinch of white sugar until well combined.\n• Cut tofu into strips (if desired).\n• Divide sushi rice and salad between bowls. Top with sesame-crumbed Japanese tofu. Drizzle with teriyaki mayo to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69115cb5806404b7ebc5afe3/step-b7853e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
